                <h3 class="heading">
                    <span class="day"><span>DAY</span> 1</span>
                    <span class="text">Arrival in Lamezia Terme</span>
                </h3>
                <i class="dropdown icon"></i>
            </div>

            <div class="content accordion-content">
                <div class="inner-content">
                    <p>After breakfast, departure to Pizzo Calabro. Pizzo, one of the most beautiful and famous fishing villages with a historical center, characterized for the narrow Streets and small squares. Here you will visit the small church of Piedigrotta that has been built inside a cave and it is
                        located on the beach, among the sea. Then you will have a break to taste the famous Tartufo ice cream, which is famous all over the world. Dinner and overnight at the hotel.</p>

                    <div class="inclusions">
                        <div class="item">
                            <span class="icon fal fa-utensils"></span> Breakfast, Dinner
                        </div>
                        <div class="item">
                            <span class="icon fal fa-utensils"></span> Breakfast, Dinner
                        </div>
